# Store's Google AI key (billing enabled). When set, the fitting room renders
# the exact look automatically for every outfit, on the mannequin or a
# customer's photo, and shoppers never see "Add your API key".
# Get one at https://aistudio.google.com/apikey
GEMINI_API_KEY=

# Fresh renders each visitor may use on the store key per 10 minutes
# (cached looks don't count). Default 20.
# TRYON_RENDERS_PER_WINDOW=20

# Optional: override the image model (falls back to gemini-2.5-flash-image).
# GEMINI_IMAGE_MODEL=gemini-3.1-flash-image

# Optional: where `npm run assets` downloads the storefront images from.
# ASSETS_BASE_URL=https://raw.githubusercontent.com/moain2028/aniq-ecommerce/main
